# MCP Azure Smart Notes

An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that exposes an Azure OpenAI–powered
text summarization tool.

## Features
-Azure OpenAI integration
-MCP tool: summarize_text
-Lazy-loaded LLM client
-Environment-based configuration

## Project Structure
-server/azure_client.py — Azure OpenAI client
-server/tools.py — MCP tool definitions
-server/mcp_server.py — MCP server entrypoint
-test_local.py — local Azure summarization test

## Setup
1.Create .env with Azure OpenAI credentials
2.Create virtual environment
3.Install dependencies

## Local Test (Azure only)
```bash
python test_local.py
